    "ReminderDue": {
      "additionalProperties": true,
      "description": "A reminder or timer came due (PL46), to the item's tenant, for the app to show a\nnotification. `text` is the reminder's words as the person reads them in it, after the\nresponse gate: null for a timer, and null when the gate refused the words (the app then shows\na neutral line naming only the time). `dueAt` is ISO 8601 with the offset of the zone it was\nset in. `missed`: it came due while the engine was not running. `spoken`: its line was said\non the device (false inside quiet hours, on another person's device, or with no voice).",
      "properties": {
        "dueAt": {
